      "side": 1,
      "message": "Hi, this config flag just indicates that the energy awareness sched feature is true at boot. In a CONFIG_SCHED_DEBUG configuration this can be changed at runtime, so there will be a number of configurations for which x86 would still lack energy model support.\n\nI think the #ifdefs should be removed unless you particularly intend to only support providing EM data for devices which boot with energy awareness on.",
      "revId": "4db64f141b7c5a6560f67e368fd926094c2433ac",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
      "unresolved": false
