      "writtenOn": "2017-11-17T12:16:07Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Where does your platform share frequency domain? Per-cluster or per-system? If it\u0027s the former, set SD_SHARE_CAP_STATES here, otherwise in cpu_clusterpower_flags(). If your platform has per-cpu frequency domains, don\u0027t set it at all.",
      "revId": "4db64f141b7c5a6560f67e368fd926094c2433ac",
